Z||000001||GarethWright||10-20-2001||03:57 AM||||Are you talking about the plastic wind deflector you clip in when you have the sunroof glass out?  Or the small "[" shaped clips that go around the holes on the roof the front sunroof tabs slide into?<BR>When stored, the deflector clips into those "L" shaped cuts in the plastic (just above the AC Accumulator) under the front lid.<P>Look for Fiero Wind Deflector on Ebay (or just Fiero like I do  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">), they pop up every so often and go for anywhere between $15-50.  As for the clips, I would talk to a dealership or scrap jard.||||reg||1
